**This is a sample post** so the blog has something to show. Replace or delete it in the admin.

For years I worked next to software without building any. This series is about changing that, one small project at a time, and writing down what actually happened, including the parts that didn't work.

## What this series is

Short, honest notes. What I tried, what I learned, and what I'd do differently. No hype.

## Where it starts

With this website. It was planned, designed and built together with Claude, in small steps, with every decision written down.

